Performs a log in to the configured Carbyne Stack virtual cloud providers using OAuth2. 
 
 OAuth2 parameters (client identifier and callback URL) can be specified using the Carbyne Stack CLI configuration command. 
 
 The command will only work on systems where a browser is available that can be used to acquire user consent. 
 If this is not the case in your setting (e.g. your system is headless), you can perform the login using the same 
 configuration on an auxiliary machine and then copy the generated configuration from the auxiliary to the original machine. 
 
 The tokens are written to '~/.cs/access-tokens.json'.
